{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdd <strong>Long Description / About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Muezza Pill Dash</strong> is a short and relaxing arcade game about care and timing.<br>Guide Muezza, the fluffy cat, as she collects her cortison pills before the compliance timer runs out.<br>Start slow, but with each pill the game speeds up \u2014 simple, snappy, and endlessly replayable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with <strong>Arrow Keys</strong> or <strong>WASD</strong> (mobile: swipe).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect pills to earn points and increase your speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the <strong>compliance timer</strong> \u2014 if it runs out, you lose a heart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose all hearts and it\u2019s <strong>Game Over!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>P or Esc</strong> to pause (the timer truly stops).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R</strong> restarts, <strong>M</strong> toggles sound.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic design inspired by classic Snake.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually increasing speed for satisfying tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local best score tracking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Option to load your own cat photo as the player sprite.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windowed desktop build (no forced fullscreen).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Family-friendly \u2014 easy to play, hard to master.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e Why it\u2019s special</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Muezza Pill Dash was made out of love for a real cat who takes cortison medication because of her medical condition. <br>It turns care into a game \u2014 a reminder that 